  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Servicios Agrcolas Provinciales V - PROSAP V</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provincial Agricultural Services Program V - PROSAP V</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es contribuir a la mejora en la productividad, la comercializacin y el agregado de valor en la produccin agroindustrial argentina, con enfoque de adaptacin al cambio climtico. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) incrementar la cobertura y calidad de los servicios de infraestructura pblica en las zonas a intervenir; y (ii) aumentar la adopcin de tecnologas que fomenten la rentabilidad econmica y la sostenibilidad ambiental, y aumentar la adopcin de herramientas de diferenciacin de producto.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the Program is to contribute to the improvement of productivity, marketing and added value in Argentine agro-industrial production, with a focus on adaptation to climate change. The specific objectives are: (i) increase the coverage and quality of public infrastructure services in the areas to be intervened; and (ii) increase the adoption of technologies that promote economic profitability and environmental sustainability, and increase the adoption of product differentiation tools.</narrative>
  </description>
